{title: Ae Jaate Hue Lamho}
{artist: Roop Kumar Rathore Anu Malik}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Ae jaate [C]hue lamho [Am]zara thehro, [G]zara thehro
[E]May bhee [Am]toh chalta [E]hu, zara [Am]unase milta hun
[Am]Jo ek [G]bat dil me [Am]hai unse kahu
[Am]Toh chalu toh chalu,[D]hmmm..
[G]toh chalu [C]toh chalu [Am]toh chalu
[D]Unke [G]chehre kee [C]yeh narmiya,
[D]unki [G]zulfon kee [Am]yeh badliya
[Am]Unki [D]aankho ke [G]roshan diye,
[G]unke [D]honto [C]kee [Am]yeh surkhiya
[Am]Sab unke [C]hain jalwe, [Am]mai chalne [G]se pehle
[E]Saanson me [Am]aankho me [E]khwabo me [Am]yado me
[Am]Aur iss [G]dil me [Am]unko chhupake rakhu
[Am]Toh chalu toh chalu,[D]hmmm..
[G]toh chalu [C]toh chalu [Am]toh chalu
[D]May kahee [G]bhee rahu [C]ai sanam,
[D]Mujhko [G]hai jindagi [Am]kee kasam
[Am]Faasle [D]aate [G]jate rahe,
[G]Pyar [D]lekin [C]nahee [Am]hoga kam
[Am]Jinhe chahu [C]jinhe puju [Am]unhe dekhu [G]unhe chhu lu
[E]Zara bate [Am]toh kar lu, [E]jara baho [Am]me bhar lu
[Am]May iss [G]chand se mathe [Am]ko chum lu
[Am]Toh chalu toh chalu,[D]hmmm..
[G]toh chalu [C]toh chalu [Am]toh chalu
